{"id": null, "n": "0296005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0296005", "type": "orig", "text": "「依」，甲本北敦01672號至此止。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0297001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0297001", "type": "orig", "text": "「是」，底本作「諸」，據文意改。"}
